## Ways to close the gap
- Confirm lift pass pre-sale dates for 2026/27 season and book before it expires
- Rent only what's needed (skip skis for anyone with usable gear already)
- Groceries-heavy meal plan can realistically drop to ~1,200 ILS
- Consider 2 lesson days instead of 3 if 10k is a hard ceiling (~470 ILS saved)

